étale, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/02GN" data-tag="02GN">29.37.3</a>, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
proper, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01W3" data-tag="01W3">29.42.4</a>, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
H-projective, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01WE" data-tag="01WE">29.44.7</a>, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
finite or integral, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01WK" data-tag="01WK">29.45.5</a>, 
